&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fh08it8qkh2pr23ww87mf.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fh08it8qkh2pr23ww87mf.png" alt="Ostthüringen regional rail transit map" width="800" height="800"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Try it
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Editor and examples: &lt;a href="https://transitmapper.github.io/liniennetzeditor/en/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://transitmapper.github.io/liniennetzeditor/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Source (MIT): &lt;a href="https://github.com/transitmapper/liniennetzeditor" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://github.com/transitmapper/liniennetzeditor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The interface is German only for now. If you make transit maps, or just like grid geometry, I’d love feedback. What’s missing? What’s confusing?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  The symptom, measured
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A site with different content on every route. I measured the raw HTML of 15 URLs — 7 static routes plus the 8 dynamic routes of one community — and this is what the server returns:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="table-wrapper-paragraph"&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;route&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;title served&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;El Arquitecto Cuántico — Libros de Jose Alexis Román Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/comunidad&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;El Arquitecto Cuántico — Libros de Jose Alexis Román Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/comunidad/arquitecto-cuantico&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;El Arquitecto Cuántico — Libros de Jose Alexis Román Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/comunidad/codigo-origen&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;El Arquitecto Cuántico — Libros de Jose Alexis Román Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/comunidad/mente-eterna&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;El Arquitecto Cuántico — Libros de Jose Alexis Román Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/privacy&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;El Arquitecto Cuántico — Libros de Jose Alexis Román Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/terms&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;El Arquitecto Cuántico — Libros de Jose Alexis Román Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/informes/ariastate&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
